cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "permsum-oeis: exact distributions of permutation sums and new OEIS terms"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nagib"
    given-names: "Victor Nidal Bassem"
date-released: 2026-10-30
version: "1.0.0"
url: "https://github.com/victornagib2/permsum-oeis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/victornagib2/permsum-oeis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - OEIS
  - permanent
  - Glynn formula
  - permutations
  - Spearman's rho
  - exact distribution
abstract: >-
  Exact distributions of S(p) = sum_k f(k, p(k)) over all permutations p of [n] for f = k*p(k), gcd(k, p(k))
  and k^2*p(k), computed as permanents of the matrix (x^f(i,j)) with Glynn's formula at roots of unity modulo
  two primes, and the resulting new terms of OEIS A073114, A073343, A189043, A180111, A180112 and
  A179263-A179266.
